    "turn_idx": 0,
    "turn_text": "Hello and welcome to the final episode of series one of how to change the world with me Alan Johnson supported by Barclays. My guest today is former presidential candidate and former Republican congressman Joe Walsh. It feels entirely appropriate to have an anti-Trump conservative on the podcast just two days after the former president left the White House. And boy did Joe have a lot to say about his former presidential rival. He's a great guest, so let's get straight into it. So I'm delighted on the day after the inauguration of President Biden. to be joined by someone who's perspective on the last few years of America's history is particularly valuable. He's former presidential candidate, a man who tried to stop Trump getting nominated for this last presidential election, former congressman, author, radio host, and podcaster Joe Walsh. Joe, it's great that you can join us. I know you're just in the morning there, 10 a.m., the morning after inauguration. Just tell us what it feels like as America wakes up on what I suppose you could describe as the first Trumpless day for four years.",
