  {
    "episode_id": 71498,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71498.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "You saw it coming, Joe. I've seen the clips of you well, in the running up to your presidential denomination. And I think before there, where you raise these issues, and that's one of the reasons why you're such an interesting person to talk to today, because you said probably the first senior Republican to say that the Republican Party had become a cult I mean, how did the party of Eisenhower and Reagan and John McCain, how did it turn into, how did it change so drastically?",
